sec.p:
One of the important topics in green chemistry is the recovery and reusability of catalytic structures in organic reactions. The reusability of SBA-15@ELA as a catalyst in the synthesis of 4-oxo-dihydroquinazolinone (in model reaction for 4a) was evaluated in several runs. For this purpose, after completion of the reaction, 20 mL hot ethanol was added and stirred. The catalyst was filtered out and washed with ethanol (3 \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
